  "status": "OPEN 2026-09-15",
  "what": "median 'incomplete' share differs across three published sources: benchmark.json q8 says 1.8% (top-100), data/incomplete-reason-2025.json says 2.2% (70 lenders) with Carrington 73.5%, this file computes 2.8% over 95 top-100 lenders with reasons published and Carrington 75.2%. Universe definitions differ (which lenders have reason fields, which count as top-100). Until reconciled, cite the universe with the figure; this entry is removed only by a dated corrections.html entry."
